{"call_id": "8df154ff9775425495591a1955252adb", "success": true, "result_file": "/data/nly/Agent-Aware-Trajectory-Level-Query/benchmark/fullbench/runs/natural/PATENTS/query2/full-01/results/8df154ff9775425495591a1955252adb.json", "row_count": null, "preview": "{\"submitted\": true, \"answer\": \"TASK: CPC technology areas in Germany with the highest exponential moving average (alpha = 0.1)\\nof patent filings per year, for patents granted in the second half of 2019 (July 1 - Dec 31, 2019),\\nreported at CPC hierarchy level 4 (class level, e.g. H01).\\n\\nMETHOD:\\n- Selected German patents (publication numbers starting with \\\"DE-\\\") from publicationinfo whose\\n  natural-language grant_date falls in July-December 2019: 34 patents.\\n- Parsed each patent's filing year from filing_date; filing years span 2007-2018.\\n- Extracted each patent's CPC codes and mapped them to level-4 groups (first 3 characters,\\n  matching cpc_definition rows with level = 4), deduplicated per patent.\\n- Counted filings per CPC level-4 group per year, reindexed over the full 2007-2018 range\\n  (missing years = 0), and computed the EMA with smoothing factor 0.1\\n  (pandas ewm(alpha=0.1, adjust=False), i.e. EMA_t = 0.1*count_t + 0.9*EMA_{t-1}).\\n- For each group, took its highest EMA value and the year in which that peak occurs (\\\"best year\\\"),\\n  then ranked all groups by that peak EMA.\\n\\nRESULTS - Top 10 CPC level-4 groups by highest EMA of yearly filings:\\n\\nRank | CPC group | Full title                                                              | Best year | Peak EMA\\n-----|-----------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------|-----------|---------\\n  1  | B41       | PRINTING; LINING MACHINES; TYPEWRITERS; STAMPS                          | 2007      | 1.0000\\n  2  | B29       | WORKING OF PLASTICS; WORKING OF SUBSTANCES IN A PLASTIC STATE IN GENERAL| 2007      | 1.0000\\n  3  | G01       | MEASURING; TESTING                         